sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Application
  participant D as Driver
  participant S as DBMS server
  A->>D: execute(query)
  D->>S: query message
  S-->>D: row description
  S-->>D: batch of rows (up to fetch size)
  D-->>A: rows
  A->>D: fetch more
  D->>S: continue message
  S-->>D: next batch of rows
